export const LABEL = "A pneumatic tube station for the team's scouting app. Eight scout desks sit along the front: red 1 to 3 and blue 1 to 3 each follow one robot on a tally counter, and the two qual desks rank their alliance's three robots on a card rack. When the match clock runs out, each desk sends its report as a capsule up its tube and along the header to the manager's receiver, where that role's lamp lights as the capsule lands. A desk whose line is down keeps its capsule in the dispatch head and sends it when the line comes back."
